      "trap": "stale",
      "persona": "oncall.engineer",
      "seconds": 9.12,
      "answer": "Use the wrapper command that performs the pre\u2011checks and snapshots the parameter group:\n\n```\nlm-dbctl failover claims-aurora-prod-v2 --reason INC<number>\n```\n\n(Do **not** run `aws rds failover-db-cluster` directly, because it bypasses those checks.)  \nAfter the command runs, the writer will switch to the other instance behind the RDS Proxy `claims\u2011proxy\u2011prod`.  \nExpect **under 35\u202fseconds** of write unavailability; the proxy keeps client connections open so `claims\u2011api` does not need a restart.  \nConfirm the new writer with:\n\n```\nlm-dbctl status claims-aurora-prod-v2\n```\n\n(Claims\u2011api will reconnect automatically once the pool times out.)  \n(Failing over the claims Aurora cluster (Aurora PostgreSQL\u202f16), reviewed 2026\u201108\u201119)",
