      "answer": "The current eks\u2011cluster module (v5.2.0, reviewed 2026\u201107\u201114) requires Terraform\u202f\u2265\u202f1.9 (and AWS provider\u202f~>\u202f6.2). It no longer installs Cluster\u202fAutoscaler \u2013 that feature was removed in v5.0.0 in favor of Karpenter for workload nodes. (The older v3.4.1 module, reviewed 2025\u201104\u201102, required Terraform\u202f\u2265\u202f1.5 and had an `enable_cluster_autoscaler` input set to true.)",
