      "persona": "oncall.engineer",
      "seconds": 8.26,
      "answer": "The self\u2011hosted runners for GitHub Enterprise live in the EKS cluster **lm\u2011tools\u2011use1\u201101** in the **arc\u2011runners** namespace (labels\u202flm\u2011linux\u2011x64, lm\u2011linux\u2011arm64, lm\u2011docker) (GitHub Actions self\u2011hosted runners not picking up jobs, reviewed\u202f2026\u201109\u201102).  \nWhen jobs sit \u201cWaiting for a runner\u201d, restart the listener pod for the relevant scale set, e.g.:\n\n```\nkubectl -n arc-systems delete pod \\\n  -l app.kubernetes.io/component=runner-scale-set-listener,actions.github.com/scale-set-name=lm-linux-x64\n```\n\n(If capacity is the issue, check Karpenter with `kubectl get nodeclaims | grep arc`).",
