      "persona": "oncall.engineer",
      "seconds": 8.13,
      "answer": "The outage was caused by a database connection\u2011exhaustion issue. In the January 2026 deploy of **billing\u2011gateway**, the HikariCP pool size was increased from 20 to 60 connections per pod. When the horizontal pod autoscaler scaled the service to 18 pods for the Monday\u2011morning peak, the application requested 1,080 connections to the Aurora database, which had a `max_connections` limit of 1,000. The excess connection attempts failed, health\u2011check timeouts triggered pod restarts, and the problem amplified itself. (Postmortem: billing\u2011gateway outage from Aurora connection exhaustion, reviewed 2026\u201102\u201104)",
