      "answer": "To roll back the commercial\u2011lines\u2011rating service, use the Azure CLI to swap the staging slot back into production.  \nFirst set the correct subscription:  \n\n```\naz account set --subscription sub-commercial-lines-prod\n```  \n\nThen perform the swap:  \n\n```\naz webapp deployment slot swap --resource-group rg-cl-rating-prod \\\n  --name app-cl-rating-prod --slot staging --target-slot production\n```  \n\nThe swap takes roughly 90\u202fseconds and warms the instances before traffic is redirected.  \n(Rolling back commercial\u2011lines\u2011rating on Azure App Service, reviewed 2026-08-05)",
