      "answer": "The OOMKilleds are caused by the pod\u2019s 1\u202fGiB memory limit being too low for long trips from app\u202f7.2.x.  \nIncrease the limit to 2\u202fGiB by editing the Helm values in `quill-gitops/apps/telematics-ingest/values-prod.yaml` (`resources.limits.memory`), not with `kubectl edit` (telematics\u2011ingest pods OOMKilled on GKE, reviewed\u202f2026\u201109\u201115).  \nVerify the HPA still has headroom (max\u202f40 pods).  \nIf restarts persist, enable the upload\u2011size guard flag `ingest.max_trip_points=200000` to prevent single\u2011request trips from exceeding memory.",
